'''im_a_squid_kid''' is an [[NPC]] in the {{zone|Community Center}}, formerly in the {{zone|Prison of the Bereft}}.

'''im_a_squid_kid''' was elected as a [[Minister Election|Minister]] to {{NPCSprite|Candidate Aura;Aura}}. When he won, he attempted to remove the {{AN|Minion Union}} perk and was sent to the {{zone|Prison of the Bereft}}. While imprisoned, he walked around the cage and sent messages in chat.

The player could use a {{Item|Rusty Spoon}} to break the cage and make progress towards freeing '''im_a_squid_kid'''.

