* The spoken line {{Mctxt|f|names noted}} is a reference to when {{RankName|YouTube|im_a_squid_kid}} replied 'names noted' to {{RankName|Pig|Technoblade}} using his alt {{RankName|Default|Whitelisted}} to spy on him<ref> https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5qjnDd1rsII&t=15m6s</ref> during the [[Potato War]].
* The {{Item|Potato War Silver Medal}} was given to {{RankName|YouTube|im_a_squid_kid}}.

